# Syndicate Diplomat (Immernacht)

# Job
job-name-syndicate-diplomat = Syndicate Diplomat
job-description-syndicate-diplomat = Represent the Syndicate openly on the station. You are an official envoy, not an agent: negotiate, make deals, trade favors and take part in normal station life. Do not attack or sabotage.
